<title>INDONESIA: Sampoerna says has 9.81 pct in Astra.</title>
<headline>Sampoerna says has 9.81 pct in Astra.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian tobacco tycoon Putera Sampoerna has said in a letter to the stock market watchdog Bapepam that he holds a 9.81 percent stake in the country's largest vehicle manufacturer Astra International.</p>
<p>Bapepam released copies of the letter to the press on Monday.  </p>
<p>Sampoerna, who controls cigarette company Hanjaya Mandala Sampoerna, said in the letter that he had bought the stake in Astra as an investment.</p>
<p>He did not specify if the shares were bought in block deals or through several small transactions.</p>
</text>
